<title>USA: Horizon/CMS settles shareholder lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Horizon/CMS settles shareholder lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon/CMS Healthcare Corp on Thursday said it reached an agreement in principle to settle a shareholder lawsuit against the company and some of its current and former directors.</p>
<p>It said that under the proposed settlement it could pay up to $20 million to resolve all claims. The class-action suit alleges the defendants issued materially misleading statements or failed to disclose material facts about the company and its operations.</p>
</text>
